  "description": "Osaka Furry Fun Festa (abbreviated: OFFF) is a furry convention held in Osaka!\r\n\r\nThe purpose of holding this event is to provide a place in Osaka where everyone with an interest in all things furry can gather and interact with each other, transcending boundaries between artists, costumer, musicians, performers and the like.\r\n\r\nWe hope you can take this opportunity to enjoy your time and experiences at the event, as well as enjoying all of the sights, sounds, and experiences Osaka has to offer.",
